---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI use"
  description="How AI tools were used in building Sackar Atlas, and what human oversight applies."
>

  <div class="page-prose section">
    <wa-stack gap="xl">

      <!-- Page header -->
      <wa-stack gap="xs">
        <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/about/">About the data</a> /</p>
        <h1>AI use</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          How AI tools were used in building this project, and what human oversight applies.
        </p>
      </wa-stack>

      <!-- The short version -->
      <wa-callout variant="neutral" open>
        <wa-icon slot="icon" name="circle-info"></wa-icon>
        <strong>The short version.</strong> AI tools (Claude, via OpenClaw) were used throughout
        this project. Anna Roberts oversaw and verified everything. No AI-generated content
        appears on this site without human review.
      </wa-callout>

      <!-- What AI did -->
      <wa-stack gap="m">
        <h2>What AI did</h2>

        <wa-stack gap="s">
          <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
          <p>
            Schema design, site build, data pipeline scripts. Built collaboratively with AI
            assistance; these are not user-facing content. The code is open source and
            inspectable on <a href="https://github.com/bitsloppy/sackar-atlas">GitHub</a>.
          </p>
        </wa-stack>

        <wa-stack gap="s">
          <h3>Research assistance</h3>
          <p>
            Scanning source documents, extracting structured data, suggesting cross-references
            between records. AI proposes; Anna verifies from the primary source before anything
            is committed to the data.
          </p>
        </wa-stack>

        <wa-stack gap="s">
          <h3>Prose drafting</h3>
          <p>
            Case narratives and analysis were drafted with AI assistance working directly from
            the source documents, then reviewed and edited by Anna Roberts before publication.
          </p>
        </wa-stack>
      </wa-stack>

      <!-- What AI did not do -->
      <wa-stack gap="m">
        <h2>What AI did not do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            AI did not make editorial judgments that appear unchecked on the site.
          </li>
          <li>
            AI did not generate facts. Every factual claim is sourced to a primary document.
          </li>
          <li>
            AI did not access sources other than the documents provided to it.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </wa-stack>

      <!-- Uncertainty ladder -->
      <wa-stack gap="m">
        <h2>How we distinguish AI contribution from primary source</h2>
        <p>
          The data schema uses an explicit uncertainty ladder:
        </p>
        <table class="uncertainty-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Label</th>
              <th>What it means</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>SCOI confirms</code></td>
              <td>Directly stated in the Special Commission of Inquiry findings</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>probable</code></td>
              <td>Strongly supported by primary sources; human-verified</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>possible</code></td>
              <td>Plausible on the available evidence; not confirmed</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>AI inference</code></td>
              <td>An interpretive suggestion from AI, explicitly flagged as unverified</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>
          Fields labelled <code>AI inference</code> are not findings. They are working notes,
          clearly marked, pending human review.
        </p>
      </wa-stack>

      <!-- Corrections -->
      <wa-callout variant="warning" open>
        <wa-icon slot="icon" name="triangle-exclamation"></wa-icon>
        If you find an error that may be the result of AI misreading or misrepresenting a
        source, please <a href="/corrections/">submit a correction</a>.
      </wa-callout>

      <!-- Footer nav -->
      <p class="back-link">
        <a href="/about/">← About the data</a>
      </p>

    </wa-stack>
  </div>

</Layout>

<style>
  .page-prose {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: var(--wa-space-3xl);
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-s);
    color: var(--wa-color-text-quiet);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--wa-color-text-quiet);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--site-brand);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-3xl);
    color: var(--site-brand);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-l);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--wa-color-text-normal);
    margin: 0;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-m);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--wa-color-text-normal);
    margin: 0;
  }

  p, li {
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-m);
    color: var(--wa-color-text-normal);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-m);
    color: var(--wa-color-text-quiet);
  }

  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-inline-start: 1.4em;
  }

  ul li + li {
    margin-block-start: var(--wa-space-xs);
  }

  code {
    font-size: 0.88em;
    background-color: var(--wa-color-neutral-95);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: var(--wa-border-radius-s);
    color: var(--wa-color-text-normal);
  }

  .uncertainty-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-s);
  }

  .uncertainty-table th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: var(--wa-space-xs) var(--wa-space-s);
    background-color: var(--wa-color-neutral-95);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--wa-color-text-normal);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border);
  }

  .uncertainty-table td {
    padding: var(--wa-space-xs) var(--wa-space-s);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border);
    color: var(--wa-color-text-normal);
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .uncertainty-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .back-link {
    padding-block-start: var(--wa-space-m);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--wa-color-surface-border);
  }

  .back-link a {
    font-size: var(--wa-font-size-s);
    color: var(--wa-color-text-quiet);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back-link a:hover {
    color: var(--site-brand);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
